{
 "duration": 25.959,
 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "The Parkers drove two hours for the view from Kuwohi, the old Clingmans Dome, in the Smokies.",
   "start": 0.3,
   "end": 5.897
  },
  {
   "text": "The gate was shut for ice.",
   "start": 6.098,
   "end": 7.471
  },
  {
   "text": "In late fall, high roads in the park can close for snow and ice, and Kuwohi Road closes for winter at the end of November.",
   "start": 7.871,
   "end": 15.379
  },
  {
   "text": "Here's the fix. Check the park's road status the morning you go, and keep a lower trail as plan B.",
   "start": 15.779,
   "end": 21.801
  },
  {
   "text": "They hiked to a waterfall.",
   "start": 22.251,
   "end": 23.58
  },
  {
   "text": "Save this before your Smokies trip.",
   "start": 24.03,
   "end": 25.759
  }
 ],
